      "writtenOn": "2024-02-12T13:15:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@henrichataing@google.com and @hallstrom@google.com\nAs per Sunny comments, current CL is sufficient for APP get the required information using ScanRecord::getBytes. And no need to have two separate APIs for Encrypt and Unencrypt advertising types.\nSo, I have the query was resolved. But if it\u0027s not resolved, please let me know if anything needs to address for these Api\u0027s?",
