      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T17:21:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is to my understanding that builder should be simpler when possible.\nLike the following\n```\npublic Builder setEncryptTxPowerLevel() {\n  mTxPowerLevelEnc \u003d true;\n}\n```\n\n@hallstrom@google.com can you review the API in this CL from both an API reviewer point of view and DRI of le ?",
      "range": {
